# CI-only tools (input to ci-tools.lock.txt). Installed with --require-hashes
# into their own virtualenv by .github/workflows/ci.yml (job supply-chain),
# never into the application's environment or image.
#
#   pip-audit  known vulnerabilities in requirements/api.lock.txt (brief §11)
#
# actionlint is not here: PyPI's actionlint-py is an sdist that downloads the
# binary while it builds, which a hash check cannot cover. CI installs the
# release binary pinned by version and SHA-256 instead.
pip-audit>=2.9
